        <mxCell id="app_dbs" parent="1" value="&lt;b&gt;💾 Persistence &amp; Streams&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;PostgreSQL (Products, Orders, Inv, KC)&lt;br&gt;Apache Kafka 7.8 (KRaft Events)&lt;br&gt;Redis Cache Cluster" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F1F5F9;strokeColor=#64748B;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#1E293B;fontSize=11;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1440" y="480" width="240" height="90" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ops_box" parent="1" value="&lt;b&gt;⚙️ AUTOMATED LIFECYCLE SCRIPTS (Platform Engineering)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Bootstrap Ecosystem:&lt;/b&gt; &lt;code&gt;.\scripts\devsecops\bootstrap-local-devsecops.ps1&lt;/code&gt; (Deploys Minikube, Terraform, Harbor, ArgoCD, Prometheus, Gatekeeper, Vault, Keycloak, Frontend &amp; Tunnels).&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Health Verification:&lt;/b&gt; &lt;code&gt;.\scripts\devsecops\verify-platform.ps1&lt;/code&gt; (Runs automated deep diagnostics of all namespaces, pods, NodePorts, and policies).&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Teardown &amp; Pause:&lt;/b&gt; &lt;code&gt;.\scripts\devsecops\teardown-local-devsecops.ps1&lt;/code&gt; (Gracefully pauses Minikube and frees 12 CPUs &amp; 12 GB RAM, preserving state).&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Total Cluster Purge:&lt;/b&gt; &lt;code&gt;.\scripts\devsecops\teardown-local-devsecops.ps1 -DeleteCluster -CleanTerraformState&lt;/code&gt; (Destroys all volumes and reclaims 80 GB disk)." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#1E293B;fontSize=12;align=left;spacingLeft=20;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="60" y="590" width="1780" height="85" as="geometry" />
